body: "## Scope\\n\\nOne coherent repository-health branch and pull request covering all currently actionable security, dependency, CI, and quality findings. Preserve behavior while upgrading coupled dependencies and automation, then record current-head proof and future roadmap items.\\n\\n## Resume context\\n\\nRepository cloned at release head 66aefca. Baseline unit and e2e tests pass. GitHub has 11 open Dependabot PRs and 2 alerts; local bun audit has 41 advisories. Continue on chore/repository-security-dependency-recovery using only pm CLI for tracker mutations."
